### PHASE 18: PRIVACY, DELETION AND NOTIFICATIONS

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer <OWNER_JWT>
@userToken = Bearer <USER_JWT>
@adminToken = Bearer <ADMIN_JWT>
@projectId = proj-1
@exportId = exp_123456

### 1. Soft-delete a project (owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

### 2. List deleted projects (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?status=deleted
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 3. Restore a soft-deleted project within 30 days (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/{{projectId}}/restore
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 4. Request personal account data JSON export (max 1/hour, 24h expiry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/export
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 5. List own data export requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/export
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 6. Check export request status
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/export/{{exportId}}
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 7. Download export JSON file
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/export/{{exportId}}/download
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 8. Delete own account (requires username + current password or fresh social confirmation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/delete
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arjunsharma",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 9. Get notification digest settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 10. Update notification digest settings
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/settings
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "digestEnabled": true,
  "digestHour": 9,
  "utcOffsetMinutes": 330
}

### 11. Trigger hourly background jobs (cleans expired exports & flushes due digests)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
